        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 87.10" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="602" ed="#liebermann"/>Secundum legem Saligam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="18" target="#Hn_87-10.lnote.oe.18"/>: Si in conuiuio, ubi<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="19" target="#Hn_87-10.lnote.oe.19"/> IIII uel V fuerint homines, unus ex ipsis fuerit interfectus, illi qui remanent aut unum conuictum reddant<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="l" target="#Hn_87-10.lnote.oe.l"/> aut omnes mortis illius compositionem<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="20" target="#Hn_87-10.lnote.oe.20"/> coniectent.</ab>
